<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Bylaws Acknowledgment & Consent - {{officer.fullName}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 12pt;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #111;
      padding: 40px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 16pt;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    p {
      margin: 12px 0;
    }
    .signature-section {
      margin-top: 60px;
      border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
      padding-top: 30px;
    }
    .signature-line {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
      width: 300px;
      margin: 30px 0 5px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Bylaws Acknowledgment & Consent</h1>

  <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{currentDate}}</p>
  <p><strong>Officer:</strong> {{officer.fullName}}</p>
  <p><strong>Title:</strong> {{title}}</p>
  <p><strong>Company:</strong> {{company.legalName}}</p>

  <h2>Acknowledgment</h2>
  <p>I, <strong>{{officer.fullName}}</strong>, hereby acknowledge that I have received, read, and fully understand the Bylaws of {{company.legalName}} (the "Corporation"), as adopted on {{company.bylawsAdoptionDate}}.</p>

  <p>I understand that these Bylaws govern the internal affairs and corporate governance of the Corporation, including the rights and obligations of shareholders, directors, and officers.</p>

  <h2>Consent to Be Bound</h2>
  <p>I hereby consent to be bound by all provisions of the Bylaws in my capacity as <strong>{{title}}</strong> of the Corporation, including but not limited to:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Executive attendance and accountability requirements (Article VI)</li>
    <li>Professional conduct and respect standards (Article XIII)</li>
    <li>Fraternization prohibitions (Articles XIV & XV)</li>
    <li>Conflict of interest obligations (Article XVI)</li>
    <li>Non-compete and non-solicitation provisions (Article XVII)</li>
    <li>Intellectual property and work-for-hire ownership (Article XVIII)</li>
    <li>Data security and confidentiality (Article XX)</li>
    <li>Anti-nepotism policy (Article XXI)</li>
    <li>All other provisions applicable to officers and directors</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Commitment</h2>
  <p>I commit to upholding the highest standards of corporate governance, fiduciary duty, and professional conduct in accordance with the Bylaws and applicable law.</p>

  <p>I understand that violations of the Bylaws may result in disciplinary action, compensation adjustments, or removal for cause as provided therein.</p>

  <div class="signature-section">
    <p>IN WITNESS WHEREOF, I have executed this Bylaws Acknowledgment & Consent as of the date first written above.</p>
    
    <div class="signature-line"></div>
    <p><strong>Executive Signature</strong><br />{{officer.fullName}}<br />{{title}}</p>
    
    <div class="signature-line"></div>
    <p><strong>Date</strong></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
